Goal Lemma 'indirect_not_equal_constants':
Assume Lemmas: 'indirect_equal_constants' 'indirect_not_in_constants'
  'indirect_in_constants' 'direct_in_singleton' 'direct_in'
Prove: (!member(0, L_Set1)) \/ (!member(1, L_Set1)) \/
